      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e If the user sets contribute_to_api to true without adding the module to frameworks-base-api.bootclasspath, the user will observe build failures.\n\nBy this, do you mean an error during Soong analysis or Ninja execution? If it is the latter, it can be cryptic to debug.",
